    "status": "present",
    "value": "Each record is one shopping session (duplicate stores inside a session count once). For every store appearing in any record, its co-occurrence count with another store is the number of sessions containing both. Return [store, associated] for every store sorted by store name, where associated lists, in ascending order, the stores whose co-occurrence count with it equals that store's maximum co-occurrence count, provided that maximum is > 0 (otherwise [])."
  },
